flowchart TB
    ENTRY[WaitForWALToBecomeAvailable<br/>RecPtr, randAccess, ...] --> CHECK[currentSource]
    CHECK -->|XLOG_FROM_ANY| INIT_PICK
    INIT_PICK{Mode?}
    INIT_PICK -->|StandbyMode| STDBY_FIRST[try archive next]
    INIT_PICK -->|ArchiveRecoveryRequested| AR_FIRST[try archive next]
    INIT_PICK -->|crash| PG_FIRST[XLOG_FROM_PG_WAL only]
    STDBY_FIRST --> ARCH
    AR_FIRST --> ARCH
    PG_FIRST --> PGREAD
    ARCH[XLOG_FROM_ARCHIVE]
    ARCH -->|RestoreArchivedFile<br/>%f, %p, %r substitution| RC{exit code 0?}
    RC -->|yes| OPEN_ARCH[XLogFileRead<br/>opens RECOVERYXLOG]
    OPEN_ARCH --> SUCCESS[return XLREAD_SUCCESS]
    RC -->|no| FALL_PG[fall to XLOG_FROM_PG_WAL]
    FALL_PG --> PGREAD
    PGREAD[XLOG_FROM_PG_WAL] --> PGOPEN[XLogFileRead<br/>$PGDATA/pg_wal/&lt;seg&gt;]
    PGOPEN -->|exists| SUCCESS
    PGOPEN -->|missing| MODE2{StandbyMode?}
    MODE2 -->|yes| STREAM[XLOG_FROM_STREAM]
    MODE2 -->|no, but ArchiveRecoveryRequested| LOOP_BACK[loop: backoff<br/>wal_retrieve_retry_interval]
    MODE2 -->|crash recovery| EOF[return XLREAD_FAIL<br/>EOF — end of redo]
    LOOP_BACK --> CHECK
    STREAM --> WR_RUN{walreceiver running?}
    WR_RUN -->|no| REQ[RequestXLogStreaming<br/>receiveStart=replayLSN]
    REQ --> WAIT
    WR_RUN -->|yes| WAIT
    WAIT[WaitLatch on WalRcv->latch<br/>up to wal_retrieve_retry_interval]
    WAIT --> CHECK_WR{flushedUpto >= RecPtr?}
    CHECK_WR -->|yes| BACK_PG[fall to XLOG_FROM_PG_WAL<br/>read what walreceiver wrote]
    BACK_PG --> PGREAD
    CHECK_WR -->|no, timer expired| PROMO{CheckForStandbyTrigger?}
    PROMO -->|yes| FAIL_PROMO[return false — promote initiated]
    PROMO -->|no| LOOP_BACK
    SUCCESS --> RETURN[return]
    EOF --> RETURN
    FAIL_PROMO --> RETURN
